  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 - Initial release\n1.0.1 - Added SetFormula extension\n1.0.2 - Added SetFormulaAt method\n1.0.3 - Bug fix for UseWorksheet\n1.0.4 - Another bug fix for WorksheetIndex\n1.0.6 - One more fix for WorksheetIndex\n2.0.0 - Switched from EPPlus to ClosedXML (MIT, no System.Drawing/GDI+ dependency so it runs on Linux). Breaking: Backer is now IXLWorksheet, style callbacks take IXLStyle, orientation/border use ClosedXML enums\n2.0.1 - Store calculated formula values when saving so totals show in Excel Protected View and previews",
